<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Spin-off of "Project: Event invite"</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }
        
        .invitation-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4b6cb7, #182848);
            color: white;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 2.5em;
        }
        
        .subtitle {
            font-style: italic;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        
        .content {
            padding: 30px;
        }
        
        .details {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        
        .detail-item {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 200px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        
        .detail-item h3 {
            color: #4b6cb7;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        
        .description {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f0f5ff;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        
        .guest-list {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        
        .guest-list th {
            background-color: #4b6cb7;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        
        .guest-list td {
            padding: 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
        }
        
        .guest-list tr:nth-child(even) {
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
        }
        
        .rsvp-button {
            display: block;
            width: 200px;
            background-color: #4b6cb7;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }
        
        .rsvp-button:hover {
            background-color: #3a5a9b;
        }
        
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #eee;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="invitation-card">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Summer Coding Workshop</h1>
            <div class="subtitle">Learn, Code, and Network with Industry Experts</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <div class="details">
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <h3>Date</h3>
                    <p>August 15-17, 2023</p>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <h3>Time</h3>
                    <p>9:00 AM - 5:00 PM Daily</p>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <h3>Location</h3>
                    <p>CODE YOUR FUTURE,TRAINING CENTRE IN LONDON <br>14 BEDFORD ROW,EC1N 2PB</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="description">
                <p>Join us for our annual Summer Coding Workshop where you'll learn the latest technologies from industry leaders. This three-day intensive workshop covers web development, data science, and cloud computing with hands-on projects and networking opportunities.</p>
            </div>
            
            <h2>Confirmed Attendees</h2>
            <table class="guest-list">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Name</th>
                        <th>Company</th>
                        <th>Specialty</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Sarah Johnson</td>
                        <td>Google</td>
                        <td>Web Development</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Michael Chen</td>
                        <td>Amazon</td>
                        <td>Cloud Computing</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>David Wilson</td>
                        <td>Facebook</td>
                        <td>Data Science</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Emily Rodriguez</td>
                        <td>Microsoft</td>
                        <td>AI/ML</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
            
            <a href="#rsvp" class="rsvp-button">RSVP NOW</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Questions? Contact ALI at alkhatabalhasan@gmail.com PHONE:07513224866</p>
            <p>FOR ALI . All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
